WEBVTT

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.120
<i>On this day at Seton Academy,</i>

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:17.510
<i>everyone was abuzz over the arrival of 
a certain special transfer student.</i>

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:26.130
<b>A Few Days Ago</b>

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:28.220
<i>For a few days before this, 
all the students in the school</i>

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.880
<b>Drawing for Jobs to Prepare a Welcome
 for the New Student</b>

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:32.380
<i>had been making preparations 
to welcome this new student.</i>

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.260
<b>Draw From This Box</b>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.260
<b>Draw From This Box</b>

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.640
<b>Decorations! 
Super Easy</b>

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.850
<b>Decorations! 
Super Easy</b>

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.730
Yeah!

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:47.730
<b>Draw From This Box</b>

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:51.480
<b>Building a Hot Spring! 
Super Hard</b>

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:03.360
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:06.210
<i>Why do I have to do this by myself?</i>

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:10.340
Will Jin-kun be okay by himself?

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.490
He said himself that he'd be fine.

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.550
We gotta work hard when we get back, too!

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:19.430
She's here!

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.930
Awesome car!

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:21.430
Sweet!

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.430
She's really here!

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:28.760
<i>The new student was going to represent
one of the world's three rarest animals,</i>

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.990
<i>the top idol of the animal world,</i>

00:01:31.990 --> 00:01:33.980
<i>whose economic effect
amounts to tens of billions of yen...</i>

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:36.990
<b>Panda Arrives!!</b>

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.230
<i>The panda arrives!</i>

00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:50.980
<b>Join the Pack!</b>

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.980
<b>Seton Academy</b>

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:12.610
<b>Unnatural interspecies relations are strictly forbidden!!</b>

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:22.620
<b>Miyubi: Dead</b>

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.330
Welcome to Seton Academy!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:16.360
<b>Seton Academy Record 6      The Legend of the Panda Girl</b>

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:17.810
I'm sorry the students made such a commotion.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:19.600
I'm Meimei the panda!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.970
It's a pleasure to be joining this school.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.150
I'm her manager, Fengfeng.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.750
I will observe these next two trial days

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.060
to determine whether she 
will formally enroll here.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.570
Understood.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:33.900
Please, help yourself to some bamboo grass.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.320
Thank you!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:44.320
That bamboo isn't the umbrella 
bamboo that I like!

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.320
<b>Moso Bamboo</b>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.320
<b>Umbrella Bamboo</b>

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.280
I'm leaving.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.540
What?!

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.300
I will have some umbrella bamboo 
airlifted here at once!

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.870
You will cover the cost!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.830
Er... Uh-huh...

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:57.210
<i>About 90% of the cost of panda 
food is transporting it.</i>

00:03:57.610 --> 00:04:00.990
<i>It costs a total of four million yen per year!</i>

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:03.220
W-Water...

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.860
This student could be quite a handful.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.850
Well, her home country has 
certainly spoiled her.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:17.360
<i>In China, pandas are classified under 
Class 1 national conservation status,</i>

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.610
<i>and they are treated with the utmost care.</i>

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.110
<b>Trial Day 1</b>

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.280
<b>A Warm Welcome to Meimei</b>

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.280
<b>Let's All Be Friends</b>

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.930
I'm Hadano Miki, the student council president,

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.450
and I'll be showing you around the school.

00:04:32.450 --> 00:04:35.080
I'm sorry I have to do this with clothes on.

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.150
Clothes?

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:37.650
Um, nothing! Now, then...

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.580
Why don't I show you the 
student dormitory first?

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:43.010
Huh?!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.430
Before that, do something funny.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.640
What?!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.010
Now, Meimei.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.010
You're putting me on the spot...

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:51.930
This is boring! I'm leaving!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.060
Please, Student Council President!

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:59.060
W-W-Wait just a minute!

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.150
I never expected this.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.740
Wh-Why don't you do the thing

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.170
that cracked everyone up at the 
student council welcome party?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:05.950
Oh, yes!

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.280
All right.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.590
Then...

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.580
I've molted!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.580
<b>Mol</b>

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.580
<b>ted</b>

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:30.140
<b>Let's All Be Friends</b>

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.610
Looks like it'll be more fun 
to look around on my own!

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:38.230
Shiho-dono...

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.740
A lion! I've never seen a lion before!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.360
Wh-What?

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.710
Are you the panda rumored 
to be transferring here?

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:50.730
What're you doing in here?

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:55.430
Oh, uh... I wasn't peeping or anything.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:05:57.760
I was just thinking, that's all.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.960
Thinking?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:03.790
I was about to cut off my mane not long ago,

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:07.410
but if I can't see Shiho-dono for 
a while, there's no need to—

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:08.430
If you're cutting it, I want it!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.370
Now nobody will be able to tell I'm a panda!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.250
<i>My mane...</i>

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.340
<i>My... mane!</i>

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.650
Seton Academy is fun!

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.030
What's that smell?

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:33.280
These are panda dumplings.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.160
They don't even taste that good.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>How to Make Panda Dumplings</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>< Ingredients > Makes 2</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>Cornmeal</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>Defatted soy flour</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>Millet sugar</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>Milk</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>(Panda milk made from a special</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>mixture)</b>

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:44.040
<b>Water</b>

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:44.040
<i>Panda dumplings are a type of steamed 
dumpling made for pandas using cornmeal.</i>

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.140
They're so cute!

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:48.660
Jeez... You're too impressionable.

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.940
Do you think the panda will 
keep attending this school?

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:51.830
She will!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.390
We even made it so she can 
bathe in a hot spring!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:57.390
If the panda happens to join the cooking club,

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:59.970
maybe we'll get lots of new members all at once.

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:00.970
Really?!

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.290
Of course!

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:04.400
She's the world's idol, after all!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:05.580
The world's?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.530
So many new members...

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.370
That's good!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:13.490
Who the hell is this?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.830
These are delicious! What are they?!

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:30.100
<i>Koalas make a "gweeeh" when 
trying to intimidate a foe.</i>

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.140
<i>It's scary.</i>

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.200
Yukari!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.430
Yukari-chan, calm down!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:36.640
Hey, I want more of these! Make me some!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.810
Excuse me?! Who do you think you are?!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:40.860
Huh?

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.540
Oh, right!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:45.740
I was a panda in disguise!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.360
The panda?! Why are you here?!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.490
Something smelled yummy.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:54.460
Oh, you followed the smell 
of the panda dumplings?

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:56.870
That makes sense, considering you're a panda.

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:00.390
Yep! I'm a panda!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.650
Everyone does whatever I want,

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:05.350
and I can get away with anything.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:08.530
Everyone loves pandas, after all.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:12.260
Right? So now that you know, 
hurry up and make more.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:14.640
Don't get too full 
of yourself, you stupid panda.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:20.380
Stu...pid... pan...da?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.980
Make more!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.150
Shut up! Stop talking!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.780
No! Let go of me!

00:08:32.610 --> 00:08:35.780
<i>Pandas make a "meeeh" sound.</i>

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:39.620
Hey!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:43.910
Excuse me! Do you think you can 
get away with doing that to me?!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.810
You'll be executed! Executed!

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:47.920
What is this?

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.650
Meimei! Thank goodness you're all right!

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:54.420
Don't run off like that! 
I was worried about you!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.430
Meimei? What's wrong?

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.870
<i>I've never been treated this 
way before in my entire life.</i>

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:04.350
<i>Who is that guy? What's his deal?</i>

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.090
A panda!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.440
<b>Trial Day 2</b>

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.440
She's so cute!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.440
The real deal!

00:09:11.550 --> 00:09:14.650
You're gonna make me those 
panda dumplings today, right?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:15.690
Nope.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.370
You're so selfish!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.450
You're one to talk!

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:24.570
I will not tolerate any rude 
comments toward Meimei!

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:26.290
Um, who are you?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.000
My apologies.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.730
<b>Fengfeng</b>

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.220
I'm her manager, Fengfeng.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:35.300
In our home country, you can be 
executed for causing a panda to feel stress!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:36.510
Who cares?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.830
When are you gonna make them for me, then?

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:42.010
Why do you just assume I'm gonna make them?

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:46.060
In our club, we all decide 
what we'll cook together.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.300
Now you know, so beat it, stupid panda!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.530
You'll be executed! Executed!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.250
So kill me, then!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.780
<b>Ye Ming Sha</b>

00:09:55.340 --> 00:09:57.780
Th-This is...

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.560
One of the legendary delicacies of China,

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:04.560
ye ming sha, made of dried bat feces!

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:06.910
Please accept it as a greeting from us.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.350
Pandas rule!

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:19.120
This makes it easy to get around.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:20.930
Please accept it as a greeting from us.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:27.980
What?! Your fans will join my pack?!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.500
Incidentally, Meimei has 1.3 billion fans.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.230
One?! Point?! Three?! Billion?!

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:39.660
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:42.660
Let's make panda dumplings!

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.270
She bought them all off.

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.250
I mean, I think it's okay, 
since she's here and all.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.770
But, Hino-san...

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:50.750
<b>Expensive Silk Apron</b>

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.880
<i>You too, Hitomi-chan?!</i>

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.020
Well, c'mon! Hurry up!

00:10:55.020 --> 00:10:56.710
Hurry it up!

00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:00.220
Fine, but you're helping, 
you stupid panda!

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:05.350
Keep it up, Meimei!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.450
You're doing great!

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.350
Knead harder.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.700
Why do I have to do this?!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.810
He who does not work, neither shall he eat.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.490
Ugh! I'm not doing this anymore!

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.220
Hey.

00:11:22.950 --> 00:11:23.970
Pick it up.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:26.660
Don't waste perfectly good food.

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:29.290
I'll pick it up!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.750
No.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.580
Pick it up yourself.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:42.450
<i>What's his deal?</i>

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>He has no affection for pandas at all!</i>

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.350
<i>Not only that,</i>

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:50.600
<i>but the way he's abusing me...</i>

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.920
<i>I mean, it's not as if I like it or anything!</i>

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.610
<i>It's just... being treated 
this way is new to me...</i>

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.450
Keep your hands moving, stupid panda!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:03.700
Aiya!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.220
<b>Several Minutes Later</b>

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:09.070
They're done!

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:11.590
Good for you, Meimei-chan!

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:13.210
Amazing, Meimei!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:18.250
Well, they're not too bad for a first try.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.770
They're mine, you hear?! Mine!

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:23.930
I know that. Just eat them already.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:34.270
The ones you made yourself are 
better than yesterday's, right?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:39.360
Hey, Meimei, do you want 
to join our cooking club?

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:40.120
Huh?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:40.730
Hey!

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:42.140
We must decline.

00:12:42.140 --> 00:12:46.710
If she does that, she'll be treated 
cruelly by that man every day.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:49.370
Treated cruelly every day...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.250
I haven't even decided if 
she'll enroll here yet.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:56.580
It's okay! Jin's always really nice!

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:01.840
No! We don't need a selfish panda like her!

00:13:03.070 --> 00:13:05.980
Why?!

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:08.650
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:10.970
<i>Red panda!</i>

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.650
<i>Seton Academy: Join the Pack!</i>

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:15.310
<i>Ragdoll!</i>

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:19.480
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:19.140
<i>When the day came, she was so cute that</i>

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:21.980
<i>all the animals thought she 
was an imaginary creature.</i>

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:25.610
<b>Love</b>

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.300
Meimei-mei! Meimei-mei!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:32.580
<b>Welcome, Giant Panda</b>

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:33.180
<i>In 1972, when pandas went 
on display at Ueno Zoo,</i>

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:35.670
<i>floods of visitors came to see them every day.</i>

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:37.290
<i>The lines to get in</i>

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:42.090
<i>were even longer than the entry line 
for the modern-day Comic Market.</i>

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.090
<b>Please Wait</b>

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:52.850
<b>Panda Enrolls!!</b>

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.990
<i>The panda enrolls!</i>

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.600
You're sure? You're really 
sure about this, Meimei?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.160
Stop asking that.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:14:03.330
Sheesh... Why should a panda like me 
have to beg so much just to join a club?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:05.610
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:07.300
What do I have to do to join 
the cooking club, then?

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.150
Meimei?

00:14:09.430 --> 00:14:11.240
Just get licked by me!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.440
I told you, no!

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:16.190
No matter how popular she 
is around the world,

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.460
she's not joining this club!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.330
I said I'm joining, and that means I'm joining!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:26.010
Then you need to get all the 
current members to agree to it.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:29.340
There's one other member of the cooking club.

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.720
<b>Cooking Room</b>

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.620
I wonder what the other member's like.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.600
Well, I'm a panda, so I'll be fine either way.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.330
You were startled when a stranger came in, huh?

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.190
It's okay, Kurumi.

00:14:49.190 --> 00:14:51.700
Hi there! I'm Meimei! Nice to meet you!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:53.990
Scary!

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:57.970
House cats usually aren't 
quick to accept newcomers.

00:14:57.970 --> 00:14:59.830
What should we do, Jin?

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.670
Well, we can either run the stupid panda out...

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:07.700
or create an environment that gives
 priority to the cat, who came first.

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.220
What I'm saying is...

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.330
Meimei!

00:15:15.980 --> 00:15:17.900
What is this?!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.380
That's too mean!

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.880
<b>Aaaah</b>

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:23.100
<i>Uh, no, I think she likes it.</i>

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.610
But is this really going to 
make Kurumi feel better—

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.260
Long time no see!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.110
It did!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.930
Kurumi-chan, that girl over 
there is Meimei-chan.

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:38.620
She's a really nice girl.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.940
So you two should be friends.

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:42.500
She closed herself off again!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.690
Sorry, Kurumi-chan...

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.390
Just give up already.

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:02.390
No! I'll stay in here until 
Kurumi-chan accepts me!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:04.820
Meimei-chan...

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:06.400
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.900
You know I can't just leave you in here!

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:13.390
That's right! We can't leave 
you here by yourself!

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:16.830
Yeah! There's no way we can just leave you!

00:16:17.150 --> 00:16:18.970
Don't interfere!

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.450
This is between me and Kurumi-chan!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:32.780
They left...

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.430
Now that I think about it,

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:38.010
why should I have to go through all this?!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:41.310
She's just a ghost member, anyway!

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:45.310
Sniffle...

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.950
Pretty...

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.460
Wh-What are you doing here?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.570
Just so you know, whether you
 approve of me or not,

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.950
I'm not leaving the cooking club!

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.880
Are you listening to me?!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.740
Since I'm a panda,

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:23.310
I've had it easy and lacked 
for nothing all my life.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:27.310
But this has been the most fun I've ever had.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:29.810
So long as I get to stay here,

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.870
I want to be with Jin and the others.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.050
Wait!

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:07.970
Fengfeng, breakfast...

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:09.990
Oh, yeah.

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:13.390
A blanket? But who...

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:17.070
A rat?

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:20.230
Wait, did Kurumi-chan do this?

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.930
Eek! The cat from the cooking club!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:28.390
Help me, President!

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:30.790
She left me a gift!

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:33.630
Oh, you're awake!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.730
Meimei! Are you okay?!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.900
Hey, let me out!

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:39.680
Kurumi-chan gave me her approval!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.470
What?

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:43.220
She ran away, but there was a rat lying there!

00:18:43.220 --> 00:18:45.350
That's proof she accepts me!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.350
Th-That's nice, Meimei-chan.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:49.890
I-I knew it!

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:51.900
Y-Yay...

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.760
Well, I guess you've put in the effort.

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.690
What? I'm not lying!

00:18:57.090 --> 00:18:58.810
There really was a rat!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:18:59.900
Sure, sure.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:02.070
Listen to me!

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.580
Kurumi-chan!

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.200
Morning!

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:15.130
What's all this?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:21.510
U-Um... Thanks for the rat.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.010
We're friends now, right?

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.190
Huh?!

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.260
Wait... Kurumi-chan!

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:35.230
What?! Why...

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.110
Hey, it doesn't mean she hates you.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:43.030
That's just how cats show affection.

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:45.910
This is great, Meimei!

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:48.950
Welcome to the cooking club, Meimei-chan!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.610
Now, as a sign that we're 
packmates, you can lick me!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.970
Lick you?

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.920
Since I'm the boss, the rules 
say you have to lick my mouth!

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:04.540
Great, we've got another pain in the a—

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:13.230
What, what, what? Did I do it wrong?

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:15.250
<i>I'm</i> the boss!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:17.320
You're not supposed to do it to Jin!

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:18.070
Huh?!

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:21.540
How long must you toy with me like this?

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:21.540
<b>Shiver</b>

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.540
<b>Shiver</b>

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:21.530
<b>Shiver</b>

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:24.030
You demon!

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:27.260
You'll be executed! You'll be executed for this!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:29.410
Like I care!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.540
It's warming me right up!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.250
Yeah!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.570
You know, no matter what he might say,

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:45.720
Jin-kun did almost all the work 
to build this hot spring.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:48.470
Huh? I don't believe it.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:53.330
Meimei, you must've gotten cold 
when you spent the night in that cage.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.680
You didn't get a cold, did you?

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:56.310
Momantai.

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:58.480
Oh, by the way, that blanket...

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.860
Blanket?

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:03.740
<b>Animal Failures</b>

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.540
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:37.500
<b>Awoooo</b>

00:22:41.270 --> 00:22:42.960
See ya!

00:22:42.960 --> 00:22:44.460
Damn...

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:47.010
This uniform is so drafty.

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:54.340
I'm sure I just sensed someone strong.

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:56.470
Did I imagine it?

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:08.910
It's dangerous to go near a carnivore.

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:10.490
Let's go, Shiho-kun.

00:23:10.490 --> 00:23:11.630
Captain...

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:21.420
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.150
<i>He's not just some bald dude!</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.710
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:26.250
<b>Ranka here!</b>

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.150
<b>Meimei here.</b>

00:23:28.150 --> 00:23:29.300
<b>In the next episode...... huh!?</b>

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:31.050
<b>A really strong student challenges me!?</b>

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:32.140
<b>So long, Ranka...... I'll take care of the rest!</b>

00:23:32.140 --> 00:23:34.140
<b>I'll be a really good boss!</b>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.490
<b>Hey!! Jin will get mad again if you say that!</b>

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:37.930
<b>Aiyaaaaa! (Happy)</b>

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Seton Academy Record 7</b>

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>The Wild Habits of a Troubled Animal</b>
